            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3390/ijms16059770</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>I have read with interest the recent paper by Han and coworkers on the putative effects of a PHACTR1 variant in the context of coronary artery disease. The authors conclude to a significant risk-enhancing role of rs12526453 on the grounds of 19 earlier case-control studies.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
